<title>USA: Americas Growth terminates merger.</title>
<headline>Americas Growth terminates merger.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Americas Growth Fund Inc said on Monday it and Advance Electronic Support Products Inc have mutually agreed to terminate their merger agreement dated July 15, 1996.</p>
<p>The company will continue its investment objective seeking long-term capital appreciation of assets by investing in a variety of U.S. companies positioned to benefit from opportunies in Latin America or the Caribbean, Americas Growth said.</p>
<p>Americas Growth chairman Leonard Sokolow said he is now considering several investment transactions for the company.</p>
</text>
